    "O gateway da empresa (ou o seu). A lista vem de /model/info, com o tipo de cada modelo. De dentro do Docker, use host.docker.internal em vez de localhost.": "The company gateway (or yours). The list comes from /model/info, with each model’s type. From inside Docker, use host.docker.internal instead of localhost.", "Centenas de modelos numa chave só, com preço e contexto de cada um.": "Hundreds of models with one key, with each one’s price and context.", "Protocolo da Anthropic: serve o harness claude-code.": "Anthropic protocol: serves the claude-code harness.", "Para o harness deepseek-harness, cadastre de novo com protocolo deepseek e base https://api.deepseek.com.": "For the deepseek-harness harness, add it again with the deepseek protocol and base https://api.deepseek.com.", "O Perplexity não publica a lista de modelos: inclua os que vai usar (ex.: sonar, sonar-pro).": "Perplexity doesn’t publish its model list: add the ones you will use (e.g. sonar, sonar-pro).", "Só embedding e rerank, sem lista pública: inclua os modelos (ex.: voyage-3.5, rerank-2.5).": "Embedding and rerank only, no public list: add the models (e.g. voyage-3.5, rerank-2.5).", "Só embedding e rerank, sem lista pública: inclua os modelos (ex.: jina-embeddings-v3, jina-reranker-v2-base-multilingual).": "Embedding and rerank only, no public list: add the models (e.g. jina-embeddings-v3, jina-reranker-v2-base-multilingual).", "Modelos na sua máquina. A chave não é conferida: qualquer valor serve (ex.: ollama).": "Models on your machine. The key isn’t checked: any value works (e.g. ollama).", "Qualquer endpoint no formato da OpenAI (/v1/chat/completions e /v1/models): vLLM, Azure, Bedrock via gateway…": "Any endpoint in the OpenAI format (/v1/chat/completions and /v1/models): vLLM, Azure, Bedrock through a gateway…", "Qualquer endpoint no formato de Mensagens da Anthropic (/v1/messages e /v1/models).": "Any endpoint in Anthropic’s Messages format (/v1/messages and /v1/models).", "Compatível com OpenAI": "OpenAI compatible", "Compatível com Anthropic": "Anthropic compatible",
